  m_Name: Evento_OndaDeCalor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Onda de Calor
  _titleEn: Heat Wave
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "V\xE1rios dias de calor extremo sobrecarregam hospitais e a rede el\xE9trica
    e matam principalmente idosos."
  _summaryEn: Several days of extreme heat overload hospitals and the power grid
    and kill mostly older people.
  _realWorld: "A onda de calor de 2003 na Europa causou dezenas de milhares de mortes;
    depois dela, a Fran\xE7a criou um plano nacional de alerta e cuidado com idosos."
  _realWorldEn: The 2003 European heat wave caused tens of thousands of deaths; afterward,
    France created a national alert and elderly care plan.
  _tradeOffs: "\xC1rvores, telhados claros ou verdes, abrigos refrigerados e alertas
    reduzem as mortes."
  _tradeOffsEn: Trees, light or green roofs, cooling shelters and alerts reduce deaths.
  _sources:
  - Label: 2003 European heat wave (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_European_heat_wave
